  "design": {
    "decision": "Every extra trick bid above 8 adds +3, so a team that can make 9 should not settle for 8.",
    "opponent": "Revealed on a made 8+; a big contract becomes worth setting even at the cost of the defenders' own bid.",
    "rationale": "Contract-scaled +mult that also requires the size, for the bid-tension target. Threshold plus scaling is one condition and one scaling, as in cb-bid8-trick-mult; it pays nothing on a set, unlike its common cousin.",
